OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cool start to the morning
OL,6,Funder clear skies. Becoming cloudier
OL,7,Fwith the chance of some showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fmainly over high ground and along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry with clearing
OL,13,Fskies overnight for most of the
OL,14,Fregion, except along the coast where
OL,15,Fit will be cloudy with the chance of
OL,16,Fsome isolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
