OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry and sunny start away
OL,6,Ffrom the coast. turning increasingly
OL,7,Fcloudy during the afternoon with the
OL,8,Fchance of isolated light coastal
OL,9,Fshowers. Winds light but breezy along
OL,10,Fthe coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCooler
OL,13,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,14,Fand showers. Showers most frequent
OL,15,Fnear the coast, though occasionally
OL,16,Fspreading inland. Winds mostly light,
OL,17,Fbut breezy at times near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
